    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d24">

                <pb facs="0148" n="42" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg42"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State to the
                            Acting Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Buenos Aires</hi></placeName>[, <date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content" calendar="gregorian"
                            notAfter="1906-08-19T17:55:00-05:00"
                            notBefore="1906-08-18T00:00:00-04:16">undated</date>].<lb/>Received 5.55
                        p.m. August 19, 1906.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I am leaving Buenos Aires this afternoon, after a most hospitable and friendly
                    reception and entertainment. Owing to the terrible calamity in Chile I have
                    advised Chilean Government that I will, with their permission, limit my visit to
                    a simple call of condolence. I have expressed sympathy in personal call at
                    Chilean legation here by telegraph.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Root.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
